TITLE Transport exchange problem
SOLUTION 0-10
    pH 7.0 charge
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 0-10
    X 0.001
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file tran.sel
    -reset false
    -dist   NaX CaX2
TRANSPORT
    -cells           10
    -shifts          10
    -time_step       1
    -print_cells     1-10
    -print_frequency 1
    -boundary_conditions  constant  flux
    -lengths         10
    -dispersivities  0
    -punch_cells     1-10
    -punch_frequency 1
    -initial_time    0
    -flow_direction  forward
END
